@startuml "pipeline.puml"
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class LogHubApplication
class LogProcessor
interface IConfigService
class ConfigService
class LogConfiguration
interface ILogImporter
interface ILogSink
class ConsoleLogSink
class FileLogSink
class SeverityFilter
class LogFormatter
class GraphDemo
class TextWriter <<BCL>>
class CompositionRoot
LogHubApplication --> LogProcessor
LogHubApplication --> IConfigService
LogHubApplication --> GraphDemo
LogHubApplication --> TextWriter
IConfigService <|.. ConfigService
ConfigService --> LogConfiguration
LogProcessor --> ILogImporter
LogProcessor --> SeverityFilter
LogProcessor --> LogFormatter
LogProcessor --> "1..*" ILogSink
ILogSink <|.. ConsoleLogSink
ILogSink <|.. FileLogSink
ConsoleLogSink --> LogConfiguration
FileLogSink --> LogConfiguration
CompositionRoot ..> LogHubApplication : constructor injection through DI
note bottom of LogProcessor
  Written counts accepted records once,
  even when console and file both receive them.
end note
@enduml
